  "body": "【Parley.】 Reveal a random chaos token from the chaos bag. If you revealed:\n<bul> A positive number or ⭐ token: Play a card from your hand without paying for its cost.\n<bul> A negative number: Search your deck or discard pile for an {Illicit} or {Criminal} card and add it to your hand. Shuffle your deck.\n<bul> A non-⭐ symbol token: Either discard 2 cards or 3 resources.",
